What this means for commercial enquiries
----------------------------------------

Everyone receives this software under AGPL-3.0. Nothing below narrows that.

Separate commercial terms can only be offered for parts whose copyright is held
solely by the author, which the GPL components above are not. The line falls
where the code does:

  Available under separate terms
      The model itself — the ESSRT formulas, the Earth Fundamental Cycle
      lattice, the deep-time engine, the fitted coefficients — together with
      services built over it. This is original work throughout.

  NOT available under separate terms
      The 3D simulator's scene-graph construction, which uses the settings-object
      idiom inherited from The TYCHOSIUM. It stays AGPL-3.0.

      The ELP lunar evaluators, which derive from ytliu0/ElpMpp02 (GPL-3.0) and
      are reference material for cross-checking, not part of the model.

The distinction is between the model and one particular way of rendering it. The
scene hierarchy this project computes — its precession chain — is original; the
inherited part is the plumbing that instantiates it in Three.js. The accompanying
website computes the same model with none of that plumbing present, which
demonstrates the separation is real rather than asserted.

