Per-file provenance for the lunar series, including transcription verification
against the IMCCE primary files, is in `data/lunar-series/README.md`.

The paleoclimate and historical-record corpus under `data/` is third-party
research data, cited where used. It has been audited per dataset for
redistribution rights; the results, with source, citation and licence for each,
are in `data/PROVENANCE.md`.

Two datasets are used but NOT redistributed, and are absent from this
repository — SILSO sunspot numbers (CC BY-NC 4.0, whose non-commercial term
cannot be reconciled with the commercial rights AGPL-3.0 grants downstream) and
the Snyder (2016) Nature source data (© Springer Nature, subscription article).
`data/PROVENANCE.md` gives the download step for both. No model physics depends
on either.
